#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: sm-stock.php
msgid "SM Stock"
msgstr "SM Stock"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: sm-stock.php
msgid "https://github.com/fdebbi/steel-marketplace"
msgstr "https://github.com/fdebbi/steel-marketplace"

#. Description of the plugin
#: sm-stock.php
msgid ""
"Warehouse of companies and professionals: every steel item they own, "
"published on the market or kept in stock only (new and reused), with a "
"reference and a location for each variant, quantity corrections, the history"
" of movements (sales accepted on the platform are taken off automatically), "
"prices changed for a whole type, printable labels with a QR code, and limits"
" per plan. Requires SM Core and SM Products."
msgstr ""
"مخزن الشركات والمهنيين: كل فولاذهم، منشوراً في السوق أو محفوظاً في المخزون "
"فقط (جديد ومعاد الاستعمال)، مع مرجع وموقع لكل نوع، وتصحيح الكميات، وسجل "
"الحركات، والسعر لنوع كامل، وملصقات برمز QR، وحدود حسب الاشتراك. يتطلب SM "
"Core وSM Products."

#. Author of the plugin
